      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Higley%2C_Arizona"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "By 2010, nearly all of Higley had been annexed into the neighboring cities of Gilbert, Mesa, and Queen Creek.",
